 ],
 "notes": "The shell deadline (120 s) is scaled to 1.2 s; its message keeps the unscaled 120. A 15,030-character result is clipped to its last 10,000 characters. SPEC AMBIGUITY: whether 'exit <N>' precedes the base64 marker."
